  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.99 - AM060 scopes unresolved open-generic registrations to compatible mapping pairs\n- An open-generic CreateMap(typeof(Wrapper<>), typeof(Destination)) registration no longer suppresses missing-map diagnostics for unrelated source types\n- Compatible constructed pairs such as Wrapper<int> to Destination remain quiet\n- ReverseMap retains the swapped open-generic shape, and partially dynamic Type registrations preserve each statically known typeof operand\n- Generic registration helpers remain conservatively wildcarded when their source/destination shapes cannot be bounded\n- No rule ID or severity changes",
